  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<h1>DEPENDENCIES</h1>\n<pre><code>-&gt; Color Converter API\n</code></pre>\n<h1>DISCLAIMER</h1>\n<p><strong>By default, this mod has been configured in a special way for <em>my own playthrough.</em>  If you wish to have a similar experience, consider downloading my other mods:</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2465/price-tag\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Price Tag</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2468/realism-mod-compatibility\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Realism Mod Compatibility</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2467/first-aid\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">First Aid</a></p>\n<h1>FEATURES</h1>\n<h5>Background Colors</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Custom colors for any item in the game.  By default, most of the items in the game have been configured by hand.</li>\n<li>Support for blanket and category coloring.</li>\n<li>Option to extend colors to the item names.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Superiority</h5>\n<ul>\n<li>Adding attachments to an item will override the background color of the host item with the highest rarity attachment.</li>\n<li>Supports weapon attachments, plates, helmet accessories, and ammunition.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689400978014270/rarities1.png?ex=692658b5&amp;is=69250735&amp;hm=dfd9cab2b92db23a7d3f83b6725024502cc069809b617e9a24cade99e5a1a575&amp;\" alt=\"r1\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689401594581064/rarities2.png?ex=692658b5&amp;is=69250735&amp;hm=7dc8e1301248db2ae6fbb386aeb1c86988d3b7516055655c4f3f3bb93eac454c&amp;\" alt=\"r2\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689401988579339/rarities3.png?ex=692658b5&amp;is=69250735&amp;hm=30c3de9a7c97e8f14c14d199e6e1a451ca8ee9be63112653971064b444f83682&amp;\" alt=\"r3\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/336226931085279233/1442689402341036092/rarities4.png?ex=692658b5&amp;is=69250735&amp;hm=6ba3fd09062acac03e8f315d124e182842d05a125347d25cada69b7a75a71184&amp;\" alt=\"r4\" /></p>\n",
